Package: PCAS
Type: Package
Title: CPTAC Proteomics & Transcriptome Data Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-09-05
Authors@R: person("Jin", "Wang", email = "jin.wang93@outlook.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jin Wang
Maintainer: Jin Wang <jin.wang93@outlook.com>
Description: Analysis and visualization of CPTAC (Clinical Proteomic Tumor
    Analysis Consortium) proteomics, phosphoproteomics and transcriptome data
    through the PCAS REST API, including expression queries, differential
    expression, correlation with genes/drugs/immune infiltration, clinical
    data merging and publication-ready visualization. Also ships the PCAS
    Shiny application.
URL: https://github.com/WangJin93/PCAS
